# Path to the test vault's `.obsidian/plugins/` directory.
# `make install` copies dist/* into <this>/mueslidian/.
# `make link`    symlinks the same destination to <repo>/dist (for live dev with Hot Reload).
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) and edit the path for your machine.
OBSIDIAN_PLUGIN_TARGET=/Users/lukas/Documents/Obsidian-Test/.obsidian/plugins
